<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en-AU" data-sig="links:bg,buttons:lift,tilt:1">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<script>document.documentElement.className+=' js';</script>
<title>Mops &amp; Spades Home &amp; Garden — Cleaning &amp; Garden Care | Camperdown VIC</title>
<meta name="description" content="Mops &amp; Spades Home &amp; Garden — cleaning and garden maintenance across southwest Victoria. Home cleaning, garden care, windows and end of lease. Call 0478 125 995.">
<meta property="og:title" content="Mops &amp; Spades Home &amp; Garden — Camperdown VIC">
<meta property="og:description" content="Cleaning &amp; garden care across southwest Victoria. From top to bottom — inside and out. 0478 125 995.">
<meta property="og:type" content="website">
