</header>
<section class="mops-intro" id="services">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head drop">
      <div>
        <p class="sec-kicker">Our services</p>
        <h2 class="sec-title">From top to bottom — inside and out.</h2>
        <p class="sec-sub">One local team for the whole property: the house sparkling and the garden looking its best.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="mops-grid">
      <article class="svc drop">
        <div class="svc-ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M4 20h16"/><path d="M8 20V9l4-5 4 5v11"/><path d="M12 9v4"/></svg></div>
        <h3>Home cleaning</h3>
        <p>Regular and one-off cleans — kitchens, bathrooms, floors and the spots that get missed. Sparkle throughout.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="svc drop">
        <div class="svc-ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 21V8"/><path d="M12 8C12 5 9 3 6 4c0 3 2 5 6 4z"/><path d="M12 8c0-3 3-5 6-4 0 3-2 5-6 4z"/></svg></div>
        <h3>Garden maintenance</h3>
        <p>Mowing, weeding, pruning and general upkeep — a garden that looks cared for all year round.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="svc drop">
        <div class="svc-ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><rect x="4" y="4" width="16" height="16" rx="2"/><path d="M4 12h16M12 4v16"/></svg></div>
        <h3>Windows &amp; glass</h3>
        <p>Streak-free windows, flyscreens and glass — inside and out, done properly.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="svc drop">
        <div class="svc-ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M3 21h18"/><path d="M6 21V8h12v13"/><path d="M10 12h4M10 16h4"/></svg></div>
        <h3>End of lease cleaning</h3>
        <p>Bond-ready cleans that cover what agents check — done right the first time.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="sparkle-band" id="process">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head drop">
      <div>
        <p class="sec-kicker">How it works</p>
        <h2 class="sec-title">Simple, local, reliable.</h2>
        <p class="sec-sub">Get in touch, get a plan, and let the team take it from there.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="steps">
      <div class="step drop"><p class="step-n">01</p><h3>Get in touch</h3><p>Tell us about the property and what you need — cleaning, garden, or both.</p></div>
      <div class="step drop"><p class="step-n">02</p><h3>A plan &amp; a quote</h3><p>A clear scope and a fair price — no surprises at the end.</p></div>
      <div class="step drop"><p class="step-n">03</p><h3>The work</h3><p>The team comes through with the right gear and gets it done.</p></div>
      <div class="step drop"><p class="step-n">04</p><h3>Walk-through</h3><p>We check it together — and if anything is not right, it gets sorted.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

