      <div class="drop">
        <p class="sec-kicker">Why Mops &amp; Spades</p>
        <h2 class="sec-title" style="margin-top:.35rem">A local team that treats your place like theirs.</h2>
        <div class="why-list" style="margin-top:1.6rem">
